Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
 Furthermore, by rotating in the \[Phi] direction by \[Phi]0, we can replace \
\[Phi] in the above equation with \[Phi]\[Minus]\[Phi]0. In other words, 
if we set a \[Alpha] = cos \[Theta]0, these equations coincide with equations \
(5.22) and (5.23), proving that it is a great circle.\
\>", "Subsubsection",
