Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["6.1.3. A curve on a regular surface is a geodesic if, \
at every point along the curve, the surface normal vector \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]n\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] and the principal normal \
vector \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]N\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] of the curve can be \
made to coincide.",
 FontColor->GrayLevel[0]]], "Subsection",
