 "\nMaxwell\[CloseCurlyQuote]s equation:",
 StyleBox[" (1) \[Del].B=0, (2) \[Del]\[Cross]E=-\[PartialD]B/\[PartialD]t, \
(3) \[Epsilon]0\[Del].E=\[Rho], (4) 1/\[Mu]0\[Del]\[Cross]B-\[Epsilon]0\
\[PartialD]E/\[PartialD]t=j",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 "\nFour-dimensional vector potential:",
 StyleBox["(5)",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
